$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=z5finser  LOC_AFTER=?

* A finite sum of convergent series (Lean Summable.tsum_finsetSum with tsum_mul_left): if each seq 1 ( + , G ) converges to L for k in the finite A, then seq 1 ( + , m |-> sum_ k e. A ( E G ( m ) ) ) converges to sum_ k e. A ( E L ) (climfsum, isermulc2, fsumser, fsumcom).

